DSH standards — licensing

This repository uses two licenses, by material type.

1. Text, specifications, checklists, documentation, and translations
   License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   Full text: LICENSE-CC-BY
   SPDX: CC-BY-4.0
   Modification notice: MODIFICATION-POLICY.md (required, prominent)

2. Code, scripts, schemas, and machine-readable checkers
   License: Apache License, Version 2.0
   Full text: LICENSE-APACHE
   SPDX: Apache-2.0

3. Marks and badges
   The words DSH-ENTRY, DSH-FLOW, DSH-BOOST and the level badges are not
   licensed by 1 or 2. Their use is governed by governance/mark-policy.md.
   No trademark registration is claimed.

Contributions are accepted under governance/contribution-terms.md
(DCO 1.1 + a non-exclusive copyright licence + an RF patent commitment), not
under a copyright assignment. By contributing text you agree that it may be
distributed under CC BY 4.0 and that modifications must carry a Change Notice;
by contributing code you agree that it may be distributed under Apache-2.0.

This file is a notice, not legal advice. A lawyer should review it before the
repository is used commercially.
